    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ NOSOTRAS ═══ -->
<section id="nosotras" aria-labelledby="titulo-nosotras">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow reveal">02 — About us</div>
    <div class="nosotras-grid">
      <div class="nosotras-visual reveal">
        <div class="nosotras-block">
          <svg class="nosotras-sym" viewBox="0 0 60 60" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="26" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.28)" stroke-width="2.5"/>
            <path d="M20 42 L30 16 L40 42" fill="none" stroke="#FAF6EE" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <circle cx="30" cy="13" r="4" fill="#E8A030"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="nosotras-accent">Founded<br>in Chile.<br>With Latin America<br>in mind.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2 id="titulo-nosotras" class="nosotras-title">A <em>Chilean</em> agency with a global vision</h2>
        <div class="nosotras-body">
          <p>Accesa was born from the conviction that inclusive design is neither a luxury nor an extra — it is the right starting point. We are an agency based in Santiago, with a Latin American vocation and international standards.</p>
          <p>We believe that when we design for people who face the most barriers, we design better for everyone. Not as a statement — as a methodology. Every project we support starts with listening, co-creating and measuring real results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="nosotras-valores">
          <div class="valor-row"><div class="valor-dot"></div><div class="valor-text"><strong>Human</strong> — We put people at the center of every design decision.</div></div>
          <div class="valor-row"><div class="valor-dot"></div><div class="valor-text"><strong>Rigorous</strong> — We work with international WCAG standards and proven methodology.</div></div>
          <div class="valor-row"><div class="valor-dot"></div><div class="valor-text"><strong>Collaborative</strong> — We listen before we propose. We build with your team, not for them.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ MANIFIESTO ═══ -->
<section id="manifiesto">
  <div class="manifiesto-inner">
    <div class="manifiesto-vertical">Accesa Manifesto 2024</div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="manifiesto-quote">"Inclusive design is not <em>optional.</em> It is simply better design."</div>
      <div class="manifiesto-body">
        <p>When we design thinking about those who face the most barriers — who use a screen reader, who navigates by keyboard, who has low vision — the result is a better product for absolutely everyone.</p>
        <p>That is not philanthropy. It is strategy. Organizations that lead in accessibility expand their market, reduce their legal risk and build more robust products. Accesa exists to support that journey.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ PROCESO ═══ -->
<section id="proceso" aria-labelledby="titulo-proceso">
  <div class="section-wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow reveal">03 — Process</div>
    <h2 id="titulo-proceso" class="servicios-title reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">How we work</h2>
    <div class="proceso-steps">
      <div class="paso reveal"><div class="paso-num">01</div><div class="paso-title">Diagnosis</div><p class="paso-desc">We listen to your context, review your platform and assess the current state of accessibility.</p><div class="paso-arrow">&#8594;</div></div>
      <div class="paso reveal"><div class="paso-num">02</div><div class="paso-title">Proposal</div><p class="paso-desc">We design a tailored plan: scope, timelines and clear metrics from the start.</p><div class="paso-arrow">&#8594;</div></div>
      <div class="paso reveal"><div class="paso-num">03</div><div class="paso-title">Implementation</div><p class="paso-desc">We execute together with your team. We audit, train and support remediation.</p><div class="paso-arrow">&#8594;</div></div>
      <div class="paso reveal"><div class="paso-num">04</div><div class="paso-title">Follow-up</div><p class="paso-desc">Accessibility is ongoing. We give you tools to keep it alive over time.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ CONTACTO ═══ -->
<section id="contacto" aria-labelledby="titulo-contacto">
  <div class="contacto-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 id="titulo-contacto" class="contacto-title">Let's talk about your <em>project</em></h2>
      <p class="contacto-sub">Tell us what you are working on. No commitment — just a conversation about how we can make your product more accessible for everyone.</p>
      <div class="contacto-info">
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">Email</span><span class="info-val">accesa.agency@gmail.com</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">Based</span><span class="info-val">Santiago, Chile</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">Coverage</span><span class="info-val">Chile · Latin America · International</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="info-label">LinkedIn</span><span class="info-val">linkedin.com/company/accesa</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ContactForm lang="en" />
  </div>
</section>

